      "description": "Flow Assistant – Network Intelligence - Flowsec Cybersecurity - SaaS DDoS Protection and Network Security for CSP / ISP, MSSP & Enterprise Partner with Us We’re always looking for new opportunities to collaborate. Let us know if you’d like to become a partner or distributor. About What we do Our Team Career Solutions Technology Case Studies News & Events Blog Contact Us Citala DDoS Protection Ceibo Web Application Firewall for ISPs Monitor Network Visibility Flow Assistant Network Intelligence Home » Our Solutions » Flow Assistant – Network Intelligence Flow Assistant Network Intelligence Flow Assistant is an operational analysis tool designed for ISP engineering and technical teams. It provides real-time and historical visibility into network activity, enabling investigation, comparison, and understanding of traffic behavior. Fully integrated within the Flowsec platform, Flow Assistant gives direct access to traffic data without additional systems or deployment How It Works Flow Assistant analyzes traffic flows across infrastructure and customer environments. It enables comparison across time ranges, networks, and traffic types to identify anomalies and investigate incidents Technology & Operational Advantage Integrated within Flowsec’s unified control plane. Provides both real-time and historical analysis capabilities. No additional hardware or external tools required. Core Capabilities 01 Traffic Analysis & Comparison Analyze traffic across IPs, subnets, and time ranges. 02 Anomaly Detection & Investigation Identify abnormal patterns and investigate issues. 03 Flow-Level Visibility & Aggregation Inspect detailed flow data and aggregated views. 04 Flexible Time-Based Analysis Correlate behavior across time frames. 05 Data Access & Extended Analysis Export data for deeper analysis. Built for ISP Operations Supports day-to-day operational workflows. Faster investigation and incident validation. Clear visibility into traffic patterns. Fully aligned with Flowsec platform logic. Business Impact for the ISP Improves operational efficiency. Reduces investigation time. Enhances service reliability. Why It Matters Flow Assistant transforms traffic data into operational clarity. It enables faster response, better troubleshooting, and improved network reliability. Platform Context Flowsec is a trusted cybersecurity leader working with leading ISPs. Flow Assistant is part of Flowsec’s integrated platform for security and visibility. Contact Us Flowsec Ltd. contact@flow-sec.com Flowsec provides cutting-edge SaaS DDoS protection solutions for ISPs , CSPs, enterprises, MSSPs, and the national security sector. With multi-tenant and global shield technology, Flowsec enables communication service providers to offer advanced DDoS protection services to their customers. © 2024 FlowSec Ltd. All Rights Reserved Cookie Policy Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Service Level Agreement Site by Imaginet About What we do Our Team Career Solutions Technology Case Studies News & Events Blog Contact Us Citala | DDoS Protection Ceibo | Web Application Firewall for ISPs Monitor | Network Visibility Flow Assistant | Network Intelligence Accessibility Toolbar close Toggle the visibility of the Accessibility Toolbar keyboard Keyboard Navigation visibility_off Disable Animations nights_stay Contrast format_size Increase Text text_fields Decrease Text font_download Readable Font title Mark Titles link Highlight Links & Buttons Powered with favorite Love by Codenroll",
