igh-level proficiency in English (spoken, written, and reading). Service-oriented approach, problem-solving skills, and analytical thinking. Advantages: Relevant certifications, such as CCNA/CCNP or similar. Experience with server environments. Background in cybersecurity – an advantage. Experience working with international clients. Location: The position is based in the central region. Job Scope: Full-time, with availability for additional hours if necessary. Apply for this Position Back to All Roles Contact Us Flowsec Ltd. contact@flow-sec.com Flowsec provides cutting-edge SaaS DDoS protection solutions for ISPs , CSPs, enterprises, MSSPs, and the national security sector. With multi-tenant and global shield technology, Flowsec enables communication service providers to offer advanced DDoS protection services to their customers. © 2024 FlowSec Ltd. All Rights Reserved Cookie Policy Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Service Level Agreement Site by Imaginet About What we do Our Team Career Solutions Technology Case Studies News & Events Blog Contact Us Citala | DDoS Protection Ceibo | Web Application Firewall for ISPs Monitor | Network Visibility Flow Assistant | Network Intelligence Accessibility Toolbar close Toggle the visibility of the Accessibility Toolbar keyboard Keyboard Navigation visibility_off Disable Animations nights_stay Contrast format_size Increase Text text_fields Decrease Text font_download Readable Font title Mark Titles link Highlight Links & Buttons Powered with favorite Love by Codenroll",
